    {
      "source": "SPI to extend Spring's default JDBC Dialect discovery mechanism. Implementations of this interface are discovered\nthrough Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> mechanism.",
      "translation": "SPI 将扩展 Spring 默认的 JDBC 方言发现机制。该接口的实现将通过 Spring 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> 机制被发现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> containing the <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> if the <a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider</code></a> can provide a dialect\n        object, otherwise <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "包含由<a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider</code></a>提供的方言对象的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a>，其中包含<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>；否则为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
